{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Clockwork Palace: Mysteries of the Mughal Mechanicum",
    "steam_appid": 3463220,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/295cc7995cb435af5c805213b382dc58.webp?t=1754316852\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a palace lost to time in this cozy Mughal Fantasy point and click math puzzle adventure\u2014solve over 40 time-based challenges with the help of a steampunk genie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Engage in a Point-and-Click Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the palace gates, click around, and discover hidden gems, engravings, and cryptic notes to gain entry. Where some players see an obstacle, others spot an opportunity\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Solve Time-Based Math Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, rotate, and sequence clock hands. Each puzzle brings unexpected challenges\u2014buzzing beetles, glowing dials, clicking gears, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.poster.avif?t=1754316852\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.webm?t=1754316852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.mp4?t=1754316852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Interact with Time Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you unravel the palace\u2019s mysteries, encounter interactive Time Keepers, Time Lines, and Time Gears that reveal a story frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Collect &amp; Manipulate Time Gems with the Genie</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As a silent traveler, use logic and carefully follow the hints given by your genie companion. Gather, combine, and split time gems to help restore the palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.poster.avif?t=1754316852\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.webm?t=1754316852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.mp4?t=1754316852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to crack challenging puzzles or simply soak in a beautiful Mughal Steampunk experience, <strong>Clockwork Palace</strong> offers something magical for every type of player. And for those seeking an extra challenge... the palace holds a secret just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/033ebba0a8377f59f611a6de3e439276.avif?t=1754316852\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/295cc7995cb435af5c805213b382dc58.webp?t=1754316852\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a palace lost to time in this cozy Mughal Fantasy point and click math puzzle adventure\u2014solve over 40 time-based challenges with the help of a steampunk genie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Engage in a Point-and-Click Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the palace gates, click around, and discover hidden gems, engravings, and cryptic notes to gain entry. Where some players see an obstacle, others spot an opportunity\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Solve Time-Based Math Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, rotate, and sequence clock hands. Each puzzle brings unexpected challenges\u2014buzzing beetles, glowing dials, clicking gears, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.poster.avif?t=1754316852\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.webm?t=1754316852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/a09e45aa6de52d32746f98ddf8d90257.mp4?t=1754316852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Interact with Time Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you unravel the palace\u2019s mysteries, encounter interactive Time Keepers, Time Lines, and Time Gears that reveal a story frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Collect &amp; Manipulate Time Gems with the Genie</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As a silent traveler, use logic and carefully follow the hints given by your genie companion. Gather, combine, and split time gems to help restore the palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.poster.avif?t=1754316852\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.webm?t=1754316852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/5805a48d49e084ab396ed24b95069325.mp4?t=1754316852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to crack challenging puzzles or simply soak in a beautiful Mughal Steampunk experience, <strong>Clockwork Palace</strong> offers something magical for every type of player. And for those seeking an extra challenge... the palace holds a secret just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/033ebba0a8377f59f611a6de3e439276.avif?t=1754316852\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
